    "remoteArtifact": "A remote hash records reviewed content identity. It does not prove ingestion or coefficient extraction. A dynamic locator without an approved hash is context only and cannot support admission.",
    "localArtifact": "A committed derivative fixture must hash to the registry value. A changed fixture needs a new registry version and a new review. No copyrighted source bytes are committed by this registry."
  },
